    "explanations": [
      "От requires genitive: бабушка → бабушки (feminine -а → -и after к/г/х).",
      "В + accusative for direction: школа → школу (feminine -а → -у).",
      "На + accusative for direction: стол stays стол (masculine inanimate = nominative)."
